      "id": "claim_def575ae51244ddcb2bba4ff919158f2",
      "statement": "The production generation path performs one full prompt prefill, then decodes one token at a time with a per-layer MixedKVCache; the canonical 12-layer model alternates 128-token windowed attention on even layers with full-history attention on odd layers, using 8 query heads and 4 KV heads.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://configs/pretrain_a100_502m.yaml#L17-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:28bcb0d97f714d2b4a517612ee891fc2372e2c4aec9dd6114403ae09d0e79d0d:"
