      "id": "claim_2cf78cf09f9f474a912bd67618e2c2e2",
      "statement": "Sampling uses greedy argmax when temperature is at most zero; otherwise it temperature-scales logits, applies nucleus top-p truncation, renormalizes, and samples with torch.multinomial, with top_p inert in the greedy branch.",
